      "created": 1791858758960,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deep dive 1: how to handle users who are following a large number of users? -> fanout-on-write",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deep dive 1: how to handle users who are following a large number of users? -> fanout-on-write",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "PEvC9IdQYc_BNbMOnkaii",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1129.678620192568,
      "y": 1514.246385849232,
      "width": 1188.9916402154865,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1S",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1310517154,
      "version": 698,
      "versionNonce": 2113835730,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791860099885,
      "created": 1791858946760,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Deep dive 2: how to handle users with a large number of followers? -> fanout-on-read\n- hybrid fanout-on-write & fanout-on-read (User.isCelebrity)\n\nDeep dive 3: how to handle heavy read traffic / uneven read? -> cache (Redis, Local Cache, CDN) k-postId v-post\n\nDeep dive 4: how to handle post with blob(image, video, etc.) -> Blob storage (S3) + presingedURL",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Deep dive 2: how to handle users with a large number of followers? -> fanout-on-read\n- hybrid fanout-on-write & fanout-on-read (User.isCelebrity)\n\nDeep dive 3: how to handle heavy read traffic / uneven read? -> cache (Redis, Local Cache, CDN) k-postId v-post\n\nDeep dive 4: how to handle post with blob(image, video, etc.) -> Blob storage (S3) + presingedURL",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
